cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying result data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "GRC-PIM: drift-gated GEMV-reusing residual calibration for soft-decision error correction in processing-in-memory"
abstract: >-
  Simulation code, RTL and result data for a reliability-gated calibration stack
  for RRAM processing-in-memory readout. The package contains a multi-cycle B'
  soft-LLR baseline, a compact GEMV residual calibrator with drift and confidence
  gates, GF(3) NB-LDPC channel decoding at the 256- and 1024-symbol scales, the
  Verilog datapath and its testbenches, the yosys synthesis script, and the JSON
  result files behind every table and figure of the manuscript.
authors:
